# Data directories the compose templates create next to themselves (and the
# same layout at the repository root). These hold a live PostgreSQL cluster, the
# application config and -- most importantly -- the user's own library; none of
# it may ever be committed. `Docker/**/runtime/` above covers the runtime half,
# but the pgvector cluster directory matched nothing before.
/zinglib/
/Docker/zinglib/

